            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor asked whether the primary significance test should ever be omitted and what other factors the PTO might consider."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f4c3f3173af07f0af8360a2540de16356c36266b5798e57bc795040ac55b18b9",
            "evidence_ids": [
